<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>ORE - Alpha Centauri - 170,000 tonnes ore Tubarao and Sepetiba/Rotterdam and Antwerp $6.75 fio 50,000 shinc/40,000 shinc 10-20/12 Cobelfret.</p>
<p>Algarrobo - 140,000 tonnes ore Port Cartier/Rotterdam $5.50 fio six days shinc 1-15/12 Rohstoffhandel.</p>
<p>Obo Basak - 90,000 tonnes ore Nouadhibou/Dunkirk $5.25 fio six days shinc mid Dec Coe and Clerici.</p>
</text>
